      "text": "[6:20AM]  #IkododuRd\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nTraffic is very encouraging coming inward Ojota from Ketu/Ikosi all the way to Maryland, Independent Tunnel down to Fadeyi.\n\nThe return journey from Dormanlong bridge through Fadeyi down to Anthony and Maryland is also very free.\nMaryland back to Odoyalaro, Ojota , Ketu en route Mile12 looks good as well.\n#FollowLASTMA\n@TrafficChiefNG \n@lagostraffic961 \n@trafficbutter",
